ted, but no sprout is visible yet. I'll check it after the trial window; planting is not proof of growth. I hope your eastern trials go well.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"wait\\\",\\\"args\\\":{}},\\\"repeat\\\":18,\\\"until\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.satiety\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"lte\\\",\\\"value\\\":48},\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"plant-cultivation\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"mode\\\":\\\"inspect-progress\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"plot-39-kai-429\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"eat\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"item-9-kai-104\\\",\\\"quantity\\\":2}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"navigate\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"commons-berry-1-1\\\",\\\"x\\\":15.6,\\\"y\\\":20.5}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"gather\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"commons-berry-1-1\\\",\\\"quantity\\\":4}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"Energy is full; further rest would restore nothing.\\\",\\\"The placed berry belongs to the trial, not the food reserve. Inspect actual changes rather than infer growth from elapsed time.\\\",\\\"The gathering destination is an unoccupied approach within reach of the observed berry source; four berries are a modest reserve.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Keep reliable observations distinct from hopes for the garden.\\\",\\\"Leave substantial accessible food for neighbors.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"shared-food-trial\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can a small, carefully sited cultivation trial produce food for shared use?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Cultivation study is complete and personally mastered.\\\",\\\"I